{"skill":{"slug":"gilbot-wealth-engine","displayName":"GilBot Wealth Engine"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1777602215002,"changelog":"Initial release of gilbot-wealth-engine.\n\n- First published version (1.0.0) of the skill.\n- Implements the base functionality of the gilbot-wealth-engine.\n- Essential documentation added via SKILL.md.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":43544,"sha256":"354d16fb0608e3f375a869060064394e77d8349fd21d25e2334fe2ffbfbdc8ba","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2162,"sha256":"14e62179702c4fee837cdf4b5a0e2dcf64c3d80042728e2a1b348f4432aa27e6","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789543699906,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"c8376369003384333c07b20ee089c0a2521feec1017f75ba6820c7a8f488c412","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/c8376369003384333c07b20ee089c0a2521feec1017f75ba6820c7a8f488c412","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780087450215},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":9,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":1,"checkedAt":1789543699906},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"medium","summary":"The skill text itself looks like a crypto-token research guide, but it is packaged as a PDF disguised as `SKILL.md`, which creates a review and loading concern.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The requested research scope implies web/on-chain market lookups for volatile crypto assets, but the artifact does not request local filesystem, account, credential, or privileged environment access.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The required artifact is named `artifact/SKILL.md` but is a two-page PDF document with compressed content streams rather than plain Markdown, which is non-standard for a skill and materially reduces transparent review and predictable loading.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The visible instructions are limited to research, ranking, and risk-summary behavior; I found no prompt override, system instruction hijacking, credential handling, exfiltration, destructive action, or tool-hijacking directions.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"No persistence mechanism, background worker, installer, executable script, scheduled task, memory write, or privilege escalation behavior was found in the inspected files.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Extracted content describes early memecoin/token discovery, wallet-trend scanning, risk scoring, and Watch/Buy/Avoid summaries; this is purpose-coherent but financially risky advice-oriented content.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Install only if you are comfortable with a non-standard skill artifact; the publisher should provide a plain Markdown `SKILL.md`. Also treat its memecoin Watch/Buy/Avoid outputs as high-risk research prompts, not financial advice.","findings":"[AE2] unexpected: Supported as a packaging/integrity concern: the required `.md` file is actually a PDF. Extracted visible text was purpose-aligned and PDF surface checks found no embedded JavaScript, launch action, open action, embedded file, or form action, so this supports Review rather than malicious classification.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789543699906}}}}}